<p>You forcefully try to turn a creature into an horror.</p><p>If the target fails a magical save against your Spellpower, its appearance turns into that of a horror for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 9, 10</acronym> turns, making all other creatures hostile to it.</p><p>Enemies near the target will have their target cleared on application.</p><p>This spell does not work on horrors.</p>